      "writtenOn": "2020-12-08T11:17:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we also do need that particular request to be of type REQUEST. Consider a multilayer request like :\nLISTEN for UNMETERED\nREQUEST for OEM_PAID\nTRACK_DEFAULT\n\nThis request may be satisfied by virtue of there being an unmetered network, but on its own that should not keep the unmetered network up – it\u0027s a LISTEN, it\u0027s opportunistic. The more interesting question is, in this case should this request keep up the OEM_PAID network, and I think the answer should probably be yes. The only drawback is battery, and battery is as very important in a car which is the only use case for these LISTENs, and the advantage is faster connectivity when the unmetered network disappears.",
